   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CGIAR 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&apos;s assessment is that support for CGIAR is the best way to ensure that there is an increased production of relevant research in the agricultural sector for increased food security and poverty reduction in developing countries. In addition, the support is seen as an innovative way for increased collaboration with other research funders internationally and contributes to increasing knowledge.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas bed&#xF6;mning &#xE4;r att st&#xF6;d till CGIAR &#xE4;r det b&#xE4;sta s&#xE4;ttet att        s&#xE4;kerst&#xE4;lla att det sker en &#xF6;kad produktion av relevant forskning     inom jordbrukssektorn f&#xF6;r &#xF6;kad livsmedelss&#xE4;kerhet och                 fattigdomsbek&#xE4;mpning i utvecklingsl&#xE4;nder.  Dessutom ses st&#xF6;det som    ett innovativt s&#xE4;tt f&#xF6;r &#xF6;kat samarbete med andra                      forskningsfinansi&#xE4;rer internationellt och bidrar till att &#xF6;ka kunskap</narrative>
  </description>
